cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Replication: Neural Combinatorial Transfer Learning on Split-MNIST"
message: "If you use this replication artifact, please cite the original NCTL paper and this software artifact."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Brian Muhia"
repository-code: "https://github.com/poppingtonic/nctl-replication"
abstract: >-
  PyTorch/CUDA GPU implementation, benchmark runners, and evaluation harnesses for a
  Split-MNIST Neural Combinatorial Transfer Learning (NCTL) replication effort.
  The artifact includes fused CUDA kernels for FMN-wrapped Gated Geometric
  Mixer (GGM) nodes, paper-fidelity PTW-DP prediction, and task-free model-pool
  retention sweeps.
keywords:
  - continual learning
  - neural combinatorial transfer learning
  - gated geometric mixer
  - forget-me-not process
  - split-mnist
license: "GNU AGPL-v3"
